[
  {
    "id": "sitl22-tab",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "SITL 09 In build out",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Proves composition across the raw surface: mavlink-in receives GLOBAL_POSITION_INT, a Function maps it to NAMED_VALUE_FLOAT fields, mavlink-build builds the message, and mavlink-out sends it. A separate inject can also fire the same build/out path on demand.",
    "env": []
  },
  {
    "id": "sitl22-comment",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "sitl22-tab",
    "name": "mavlink-in -> function -> mavlink-build -> mavlink-out",
    "info": "Connection: ArduPilot bind 0.0.0.0:14550 -> remote 127.0.0.1:14551.\n\nThe receive path subscribes to GLOBAL_POSITION_INT and debugs the decoded payload. The same decoded message also feeds a Function that maps relative_alt to a NAMED_VALUE_FLOAT payload override. The Build node merges msg.payload on top of its configured fields, emits a build envelope, and mavlink-out sends it.\n\nThe inject path sends a static NAMED_VALUE_FLOAT through the same Build -> Out path so a lab harness can trigger the flow without waiting for inbound telemetry.",
    "x": 320,
    "y": 40,
    "wires": []
  },
  {
    "id": "sitl22-identity",
    "type": "mavlink-local-identity",
    "name": "GCS identity",
    "role": "gcs",
    "sourceSystemId": 255,
    "sourceComponentId": 190,
    "heartbeatType": "MAV_TYPE_GCS",
    "heartbeatAutopilot": "MAV_AUTOPILOT_INVALID"
  },
  {
    "id": "sitl22-vehicle",
    "type": "mavlink-vehicle",
    "name": "ArduCopter sysid 1",
    "vehicleFamily": "copter",
    "firmware": "ardupilot",
    "dialect": "ardupilotmega",
    "defaultTargetSystem": 1,
    "defaultTargetComponent": 1,
    "paramDefsUrl": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "sitl22-connection",
    "type": "mavlink-connection",
    "name": "UDP ArduPilot SITL",
    "mode": "udp",
    "bindHost": "0.0.0.0",
    "bindPort": 14550,
    "remoteHost": "127.0.0.1",
    "remotePort": 14551,
    "vehicle": "sitl22-vehicle",
    "localIdentity": "sitl22-identity",
    "additionalIdentities": [],
    "signOutbound": false,
    "requireSigned": false,
    "acceptInvalid": false,
    "linkId": 0,
    "staleMs": "",
    "expireMs": "",
    "disabled": false
  },
  {
    "id": "sitl22-in-gpi",
    "type": "mavlink-in",
    "z": "sitl22-tab",
    "name": "GLOBAL_POSITION_INT",
    "connection": "sitl22-connection",
    "messages": [
      "GLOBAL_POSITION_INT"
    ],
    "sysid": "",
    "compid": "",
    "changedOnly": false,
    "rateLimit": 1,
    "x": 160,
    "y": 170,
    "wires": [
      [
        "sitl22-debug-gpi",
        "sitl22-gpi-to-nvf"
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sitl22-gpi-to-nvf",
    "type": "function",
    "z": "sitl22-tab",
    "name": "GPI relative_alt -> NVF payload",
    "func": "const payload = msg.payload;\nmsg.payload = {\n  time_boot_ms: payload.time_boot_ms,\n  name: 'gpi_alt',\n  value: Number(payload.relative_alt) / 1000\n};\nreturn msg;",
    "outputs": 1,
    "timeout": "",
    "noerr": 0,
    "initialize": "",
    "finalize": "",
    "libs": [],
    "x": 430,
    "y": 200,
    "wires": [
      [
        "sitl22-build-nvf"
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sitl22-inject-nvf",
    "type": "inject",
    "z": "sitl22-tab",
    "name": "Send static NVF",
    "props": [
      {
        "p": "payload",
        "v": "{\"time_boot_ms\":0,\"name\":\"lab\",\"value\":22}",
        "vt": "json"
      }
    ],
    "repeat": "",
    "crontab": "",
    "once": false,
    "onceDelay": 0.1,
    "topic": "",
    "payload": "",
    "payloadType": "date",
    "x": 160,
    "y": 320,
    "wires": [
      [
        "sitl22-build-nvf"
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sitl22-build-nvf",
    "type": "mavlink-build",
    "z": "sitl22-tab",
    "name": "NAMED_VALUE_FLOAT (build)",
    "dialect": "__vehicle",
    "vehicle": "sitl22-vehicle",
    "connection": "sitl22-connection",
    "messageName": "NAMED_VALUE_FLOAT",
    "fields": "{\"time_boot_ms\":0,\"name\":\"lab\",\"value\":0}",
    "tier": "build",
    "band": "2",
    "repeatMs": 0,
    "x": 690,
